      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ============================================================
     REAL STORIES. REAL GROWTH.
     ============================================================ */}
  <section class="px-4 md:px-6 py-4 md:py-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto bg-gb-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gb-navy">Real Stories. Real Growth.</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm md:text-base text-gb-text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Behind every review is a student building confidence, developing discipline, and learning practical self-defense in a positive, family-friendly environment. Here's what our members are saying about their journey.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 inline-block">
          <CTAButton variant="primary" label="Claim My Free 3-Class Pass" href="#trial" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ============================================================
     WHY GRACIE BARRA WHITTIER — split layout
     ============================================================ */}
  <section class="px-4 md:px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 md:gap-6 items-stretch">
      <div class="relative bg-gb-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-gb-bg-light min-h-[320px] md:min-h-full">
        <img
          src="/images/home/why-section.jpg"
